# Copy to .env and fill in. Never commit real tokens.
#
# NOTHING HERE IS REQUIRED. A fresh machine runs the whole pipeline with no
# credentials: every model it opens is either a public repo or, in diarization's
# case, already in the box.
#
# HF_TOKEN is only useful together with DUB_DIARIZATION_HUB below, to fetch the
# gated upstream diarization pipeline instead of the CC-BY-4.0 copy of the same
# weights that ships with the app. Create one at
# https://huggingface.co/settings/tokens and accept the terms on
# https://huggingface.co/pyannote/speaker-diarization-community-1
HF_TOKEN=

# Where the diarization pipeline is loaded from: a Hugging Face repo id, or a
# local directory. Unset (the default) means the bundled weights at
# third_party/pyannote-speaker-diarization-community-1 no token, no download.
# DUB_DIARIZATION_HUB=pyannote/speaker-diarization-community-1
